#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:165
msgid "rootProject and autoAggregate"
msgstr "rootProject と autoAggregate"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:167
msgid "sbt 2.0 adds `rootProject` macro:"
msgstr "sbt 2.0 は `rootProject` マクロを追加する:"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:173
msgid ""
"This is a shortcut for `(project in file(\".\"))`, which tends to be a "
"boilerplate in `build.sbt`."
msgstr "これは `build.sbt` に頻出する `(project in file(\".\"))` 略記法だ。"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:180
msgid ""
"sbt 2.0 also adds `autoAggregate` method, which at the loading time expands "
"to local subprojects."
msgstr ""
"sbt 2.0 は、ロード時にローカルの全サブプロジェクトに展開する `autoAggregate` "
"メソッドを追加する。"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:182
msgid "Maven BOM (Bill of Materials) usage"
msgstr "Maven BOM (Bill of Materials) の使用"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:184
msgid ""
"sbt 2.0 adds Maven BOM (Bill of Materials) usage support. Subprojects can "
"depend on published BOM artifacts using `.pomOnly()`:"
msgstr ""
"sbt 2.0 は Maven BOM (Bill of Materials) の使用を追加する。サブプロジェクト"
"は `.pomOnly()` を使って BOM アーティファクトに依存することができる:"

